{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01832","headline":"杂曲歌辞 生别离 · 白居易","name":"杂曲歌辞 生别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"食蘖不易食梅难，蘖能苦兮梅能酸。\n未如生别之爲难，苦在心兮酸在肝。\n晨鸡载鸣残月没，征马重嘶行人出。\n回看骨肉哭一声，梅酸蘖苦甘如蜜。\n黄河水白黄云秋，行人河边相对愁。\n天寒野旷何处宿？棠梨叶战风飕飕。\n生离别，生离别，忧从中来无断绝。\n忧积心劳血气衰，未年三十生白发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}